File: python/libxml.c
Line: 2390
Function: libxml_children
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: cur is obtained via PyxmlNode_Get(obj) and used (cur->type) without verifying cur != NULL. Invalid inputs that yield NULL from PyxmlNode_Get lead to NULL pointer dereference.

